"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4378050","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1846651706691461","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is participating in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!🎉 The Demo is taking part in this Steam Next Fest running from October 19-26, 2026!💫 If you're a fan of ⚔️turn-based tactical battles where fear is your strength and weakness, 🌳stealthily prowling around the wilderness to ambush your foes, and 🐾hunting folklore beasts by following pawprint and scent trails, check out the 🐺Hunt for the Lost Folktales Demo during Steam Next Fest!📺 New Gameplay TrailerWith so many updates since the initial demo launch, I created a ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691461","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1846018067926852","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.5! More Upgrades!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the latest Demo Patch (v1.5.26.1007) to bring improvements to expand the Party Upgrades and add more polish to the demo! Check the patch notes below for details!⚙️ Demo ImprovementsUpgradesAdded more skill upgrades (10-12 for each party recruit) to allow more combat skill customizationAdded skill branches for party upgrades to allow more choice in shaping your playstyleAdded Reset Upgrades option to allow players to respec t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T17:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1844751498226031","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"announcement","title":"Participating in the Game Devs of Color Expo!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!Just an announcement that Hunt for the Lost Folktales is participating in the Game Devs of Color Expo that is running its Steam Sale event from September 25 - October 2, 2026. Celebrating games created by people from all around the world from different cultures, backgrounds, and voices coming together to share their creations through gaming!As a game developer of color, I hope to share folklore stories from around the world through the folktale beasts you track an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T22:03:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1839676055891095","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.4 improves Tutorial!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the latest Demo Patch (v1.4.26.0801) to bring more improvements to the demo! Check the patch notes below for details!⚙️ Demo ImprovementsTutorialTutorials are now shown in center view and disables gameplay inputs until the tutorial is dismissedSome Tutorials have multiple panels to read through to help present information in smaller chunksUpdated images for Tutorials to help with new flow of information presentedAdded \"Wolf ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T17:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055891095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1836506165557374","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.3 with New Game Bug Fix","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a quick fix (v1.3.26.0628) for a softlock bug with Demo Patch v1.3 that affects only the New Game flow for new players who don't have an already existing save data file.🔨 Demo Bug FixesFixed New Game flow where \"Choose your starting Difficulty Mode\" popup did not appear for fresh New Games (no previous save file) which prevented players from starting a new game📢 Have feedback to share?With lots of updates from the latest demo patch v1.3, it was a lot of wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T23:19:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165557374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1836506165556845","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.3 introduces Difficulty Modes!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the latest Demo Patch (v1.3.26.0627) to bring more improvements to the demo! Check the patch notes below for details!⚙️ Demo Improvements New ContentIntroducing 3 Difficulty Modes:Story Mode - For shorter & easier battles (Enemies start with more Fear)Hunter Mode - For balanced battles (Players & Enemies both start with 1 Fear)Tactician Mode - For more challenging battles (Enemies start with a Buff/Passive)Starting a New Gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T17:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1833968530890010","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is participating in Strategems!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!Excited to share the news that the Demo is taking part in the Strategems Event!This is the first ever Steam event that the game will be a part of and I'm so grateful to be joining in alongside all the other indie strategy gems!📜 Since Demo Launch one month ago...📝 There have been 2 patches to bring a variety of gameplay improvements and bug fixes to the demo.💬 Here's a quick recap of the bigger gameplay changes:Shorter Tutorial - get your 1st party recruit faster ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T03:30:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890010","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1832700592799143","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.2 (mini update)","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the mini Demo Patch (v1.2.26.0518) to bring QoL (quality of life) improvements and bug fixes to the demo!📝Note: The Demo Patch version is displayed in the bottom left corner of the Main Menu screen.⚙️ Demo ImprovementsUpdated characters with Line Move skills (Teakettler, Water Leaper, Dingbat, Wraith) to allow them to pass through other characters to make them more versatile in navigating a crowded battlefieldUpdated the Tea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T17:05:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592799143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1831432155571989","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.1 out today!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the first Demo Patch (v1.1.26.501) to refine the tutorial to shorten the time to get to your 1st party recruit, additional clarity on quest objectives, tuned animation times to allow quicker inputs for exploring and combat, expanded the Compendium with Trinkets and Puzzle Scrolls pages, added audio for the Bird Scribes, and various bug fixes!⚙️ Demo ImprovementsAdded another objective to the Ghost Hunt side quest and reduced","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T17:03:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1830163047261097","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"announcement","title":"Ready to Hunt? Play the Demo!","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update to share the news that the Demo is finally out and you can play it now!Also in this post, I'll be sharing the new Demo Launch trailer, give a brief rundown of the Demo gameplay content, and a thank you message from the little team creating this little indie game!🎞️ Demo Launch TrailerPut together a new trailer for Demo Launch day! (YouTube video below)🎉 Play the Demo!The demo will feature 2 hunt contracts to give the players a sen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T18:20:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1828441623110276","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming Soon - New Trailer","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is a little developer update about the Demo coming to Steam next month & to share a new Demo Reveal Trailer to give a little teaser of what's to come!🎞️ New Demo Reveal TrailerBeen working on getting new trailers for the upcoming Demo Launch, here is a look at the Demo Reveal Trailer to share a short glimpse of what you can find in the demo experience:🎮 Demo Coming SoonReally soon, in fact the Demo is dropping next month in April 2026!The exact date will be a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-30T17:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623110276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1823191198607835","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #2 - Demo Build","summary":"🐺 Greeting Huntresses & Hunters!This is another little developer update about the demo steam page and the development progress on the demo build!📜 Demo Steam PageThe demo now has it's own steam page!When the demo drops this Spring, you'll get an early glimpse of the folklore hunting, turn-based battles gameplay in a shortened experience through 2 hunt contracts.Help shape the game as there will be a feedback survey and bug report links in the demo main menu screen to gather reviews and feedback ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-31T18:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198607835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3834100-1816849002018706","game_id":"steam-3834100","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #1 - Roadmap to Demo","summary":"👋 Hello there!This is a little developer update about the roadmap to bring a demo of the game to Steam!🗺️ Roadmap to DemoRoughly targeting for a Spring 2026 timeline for a demo launch!For the rest of the 2025 year, I'll be building out the demo 